| **Merge Conflicts** | Manual resolution | Manual resolution | **LLM Semantic AST Merge Referee** |
| **Cost Efficiency** | 100% Frontier Model pricing ($$$) | 100% Frontier Model pricing ($$$) | **10–15x cheaper (Dual-Tier Cascade Routing)** |

